30.03.15 - Keep Walking Litle Doggie!&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
A couple of years ago I got a very similar photo in almost exactly the same place as Mr Willis bumped into two swans on the riverside footpath. There was quite a bit of spitting from the swans, but otherwise the encounter passed peacefully. The swans are showing all the signs of building a nest, just like they did two years ago when they had at least 9 babies, so I'll be keeping an eye on them :)
